                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Came back to play this on a whim, only to find out that at some point the servers stopped recording matches properly and every 3rd or 4th game it will get to the end, fail to connect, and then invalidate the match just listing it as a \"friendly\" and require you to replay it again..\n\nThis is a singleplayer game mode, what the hell are you doing?\n\nThe only solution I've found is to block the game on the firewall so it starts in offline mode, or sign out of my account and ignore all the prompts to sign in again. But this prevents you using any team you created when online originally, so I either have to live with the frustration of replaying matches over and over, or starting completely from scratch...\n\nJust put out a patch to remove the online server check in at this point, you've already got the sequel out for people who want to participate in the live service nonsense.",
